\newlabel{fig:id stromquelle}{{3.3}{14}{\textbf {Ideal general power source.} Always supplies a constant current $I_\mathrm {q}$, regardless of the load, and automatically adjusts the voltage to maintain the constant current}{figure.caption.21}{}}
