\newlabel{fig:re stromquelle}{{3.4}{14}{\textbf {Real current source with internal resistance.} The current $I_\mathrm {q}$ is influenced by the internal resistance $R_\mathrm {i}$ and is lower at the output terminals}{figure.caption.22}{}}
